The largest responses occur in 'look forward to'. Smaller positive responses
mark 'happy/ready/here to', examples of something, and requests to read more.
Elsewhere the prediction is zero, except for a document-start bias, a
negative chat-start marker and a strong initial list bullet. State resets
at each document boundary. 'How do' gets a negative response.

