     JSON or a Python string with \\" quotes, the component is strongly positive (~+2.6);
   - in LaTeX math (a $ or & in the recent text, a row break), it is negative
     (~-1.9 for `\\`, ~-3.7 for ` \\`);
   - otherwise (ordinary code escapes such as regexes) it is mildly positive (~+1.8).
2. A lone space token that starts a line (right after a newline, real or written
   as the two characters \\n) fires moderately (~+0.9 and ~+1.5).
3. Two rare, very literal quirks: the colon in a document that opens with
